  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till den tekniska enheten inom RIC (Repatriation Information Centre). RIC drivs av International Centre for Migration Policy Development (ICMPD). M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att genom tillhandh&#xe5;llande av  information m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra en &#xf6;kad &#xe5;tervandring. Finansieringen &#xe4;r avsedd f&#xf6;r sex m&#xe5;nader av projektet. 934.000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the IT unit within the Repatriation Information Centre, RICRIC is administered by the International Centre for Migration Policy Development (ICMPD). The goal is to further the repatriation and return effort in Bosnia through general information. The funding is covering six months of project activities. 934.000 SEK</narrative>
